| Comment: Sudo Command Abuse by Non-Admin User
| MITRE ATT&CK: T1548.003 - Abuse Elevation Control: Sudo
| Tactic: Privilege Escalation
| Description: Detects sudo usage by users outside known admin accounts
| Alert Schedule: Every 5 minutes | Severity: Medium
| Note: Update the NOT list with your actual admin usernames

index="soc_lab" "sudo"
| rex "(?P<sudo_user>[\w-]+) : TTY"
| search NOT sudo_user IN ("root", "ubuntu", "admin")

